WEBVTT

NOTE English descriptive captions for the silent FlashLearn PWD demo video.

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
On the tablet's home screen, we tap the FlashLearn PWD icon.

00:05.000 --> 00:11.000
The app opens — no login and no sign-up appear.

00:11.000 --> 00:13.500
A friendly splash screen: "FlashLearn — Learn words through play!"

00:13.500 --> 00:18.000
"Welcome back!" The profile list shows a teacher and students with visual, hearing, motor, or cognitive needs.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.500
Tapping "Add New Profile" shows the choices: Player, Student (PWD), Teacher, Child (PWD), or Parent/Guardian.

00:24.500 --> 00:33.500
Choosing "Child Profile" asks only for the home-group code shared by a parent or guardian.

00:33.500 --> 00:36.500
"Parent/Guardian Profile" opens a simple setup: a name, an avatar, and an optional PIN lock.
